{
  "info": {
    "name": "RLNA API",
    "description": "Every endpoint of the RLNA public API.\n\nSet `baseUrl` and `accessToken` in the collection variables. The access token comes from the Neon Auth /token endpoint after signing in.\n\nNote that a resource belonging to another user returns 404, never 403. The API does not confirm that another user's resource exists.",
